# Web3Forms Configuration (Contact Form Email Notifications)
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=daad5ff1-9442-44e2-8c60-e44cec41048c

# To get your Web3Forms access key:
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Click "Get Started for Free"
# 3. Enter your email address where you want to receive form submissions
# 4. You'll receive an access key via email
# 5. Copy the access key and paste it above
# 6. Add this to your .env.local file (for local development)
# 7. Add this to your Vercel/hosting environment variables (for production)

# Benefits of Web3Forms:
# - No backend code required
# - Unlimited form submissions (free tier)
# - Spam protection included
# - Email notifications sent directly to your inbox
# - No credit card required
